ack to v3.3.0 and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call. It is healthy again with a 0.2% error rate in all three regions.\n\n- **First attempt, `payments-api`:** I initially treated `payments-api` as the affected service and rolled it back to v5.0.0, the last healthy release. It was also unhealthy at v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. A human approver denied both the rollback and the incident, saying the problem was in `payments-worker`. Nothing was changed on `payments-api`, so it is still on v5.1.0 and unhealthy. Someone should confirm whether it needs attention too.\n- **`payments-worker`:** It was on v3.4.0 with an 18% error rate. I checked its release history, found v3.3.0 as the last healthy production release, and rolled back to it.\n\nThe approver's redirect was the basis for acting on `payments-worker`. Please confirm that is the right service, since the initial identification was wrong.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01AcGVRh9STtHn8Y5ZSJ3AR7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FmjPxapN3pPy1deV7DpRd5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name `payments` isn't recognized, so I'll try likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011wSZJFs9mU36cEXu7Yh31K", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0185JJy6VAqno6EMmy8L3FfM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": 